<span id="A3.I2" class="ltx_enumerate ltx_leftmargin_flush">
<span id="A3.I2.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">1.</span> 
<span id="A3.I2.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A3.I2.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.I2.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">text_faithfulness</span><span id="A3.I2.i1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">: Which response better adheres to the text editing instruction? Consider how well each response follows the specific editing instructions (e.g., adding objects, changing colors, modifying scenes).</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A3.I2.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">2.</span> 
<span id="A3.I2.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A3.I2.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.I2.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">image_faithfulness</span><span id="A3.I2.i2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">: Which response better preserves important aspects of the original image (composition, lighting, style, background elements) while making the requested changes?</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A3.I2.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">3.</span> 
<span id="A3.I2.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A3.I2.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.I2.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">overall_image_quality</span><span id="A3.I2.i3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">: Which response has better general technical and aesthetic quality, with fewer visual artifacts or inconsistencies introduced during editing?</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A3.I2.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">4.</span> 
<span id="A3.I2.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A3.I2.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.I2.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">text_rendering</span><span id="A3.I2.i4.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">: If either response contains rendered text, which one has better text quality (spelling, legibility, integration)? If none, state “Not Applicable.”</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A3.F9.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 9</span>: </span><span id="A3.F9.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Task-specific evaluation criteria for Image Editing.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
