<span id="A3.I3.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.I3.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">text_faithfulness</span><span id="A3.I3.i1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">: Which response better adheres to the text instruction?</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A3.I3.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">2.</span> 
