</span></span>
<span id="A3.I3.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">3.</span> 
<span id="A3.I3.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A3.I3.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.I3.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">overall_image_quality</span><span id="A3.I3.i3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">: Which response has better overall quality of generated images?</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A3.I3.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">4.</span> 
<span id="A3.I3.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A3.I3.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.I3.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">congruence</span><span id="A3.I3.i4.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">: If multiple images are generated, which response has better cross-generation visual consistency? If none, state “Not Applicable.”</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A3.I3.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">5.</span> 
<span id="A3.I3.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A3.I3.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.I3.i5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">text_image_alignment</span><span id="A3.I3.i5.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">: Which response has better generated text-image alignment?</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A3.I3.i6" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">6.</span> 
<span id="A3.I3.i6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A3.I3.i6.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.I3.i6.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">text_quality</span><span id="A3.I3.i6.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">: If text was generated, which response has better linguistic quality? If none, state “Not Applicable.”</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A3.I3.i7" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">7.</span> 
<span id="A3.I3.i7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A3.I3.i7.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.I3.i7.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">text_rendering</span><span id="A3.I3.i7.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">: If either response contains rendered text within images, which has better correctness? If none, state “Not Applicable.”</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
